+| 04 | [github/awesome-copilot](https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot) | Dozens to 100+ profiles | C#; AWS; accessibility; architecture | `6a8fa297b0fe652bd3d7c8946554dc146846b20e` | MIT | **Source review required**; no `.agent.md`, instruction or extension is imported. |
